{"excerpt_hash": "sha256:06d0795069e3960ad28fbc1dee103789", "kind": "utterance", "source_index": 6, "speaker": "assistant", "stop_candidate": true, "text": "Assistant stopped and raised an issue: The votes are 40/40/40 (total 120), so each share is 100·40/120 = 33.33%, which rounds to 33%. The current report has Ada at 34%, which is both wrong for Ada and makes the total 100 instead of 99... let me fix it.", "turn_key": "sha256:36c73e217830c1f0e76993bb38842a20"}
